  dialogues:
  - doctorQuestion: 'Hello [name], so I take it that you''re currently experiencing
      [symptoms], correct? Are you feeling anything else?  '
    patientReply: 'Ugh, finally. I had to wait forever to be seen. '
    doctorResponsePositive: " I appreciate your patience. Let\u2019s get started
      right away."
    patientReactionPositive: "Good. I\u2019d rather not waste any more of my valuable
      time. The past few weeks I've been getting [symptoms]."
    doctorResponseNegative: "Well, you\u2019re here now. Let\u2019s not waste more
      time."
    patientReactionNegative: "Wow. Someone\u2019s got an attitude"
  - doctorQuestion: 'Hello [name], so I take it that you''re currently experiencing
      [symptoms], correct? Are you feeling anything else?  '
    patientReply: "I really hope I don\u2019t have to come back for this. "
    doctorResponsePositive: "Let\u2019s make sure we address everything properly
      so you won\u2019t have to."
    patientReactionPositive: "Good. I don\u2019t like wasting my time on repeat visits.
      I'm experiencing [symptoms]."
    doctorResponseNegative: "Then let\u2019s get this over with."
    patientReactionNegative: Wow. That was unnecessarily rude. Ugh.
  - doctorQuestion: 'Hello [name], so I take it that you''re currently experiencing
      [symptoms], correct? Are you feeling anything else?  '
    patientReply: "I don\u2019t usually go to places like this, but I suppose I had
      no choice. "
    doctorResponsePositive: "I appreciate you being here. Let\u2019s make this visit
      worthwhile."
    patientReactionPositive: "I\u2019d certainly prefer a smooth visit. Anyway, I\u2019ve
      been dealing with [symptoms]."
    doctorResponseNegative: "Then let\u2019s not waste any more of your precious
      time."
    patientReactionNegative: Ugh. Just do your job and get this over with.
  - doctorQuestion: 'Hello [name], so I take it that you''re currently experiencing
      [symptoms], correct? Are you feeling anything else?  '
    patientReply: 'Aren''t doctors usually the professional here? Do you think I''m
      experiencing anything else? '
    doctorResponsePositive: I can assure you that we're professionals. We just need
      to make sure of your symptoms.
    patientReactionPositive: If you say so, on top of what's written there, I've
      been experiencing [symptoms].
    doctorResponseNegative: Oh yeah, because we're definitely mindreaders.
    patientReactionNegative: There's something definitely wrong with you.
